<title>FRANCE: French March official reserves rise 4.41 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>French March official reserves rise 4.41 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and the finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  March  Feb</p>
<p> Total reserves		   310.802  306.394</p>
<p> Gold				 159.521  159.521</p>
<p> Ecu				   51.078   51.078</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  81.354   76.931</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  18.849   18.864</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
